- The reporting on the ISA 31st Session derives from specialized industry analyses (such as oceanminingintel.com) which, while closely aligned with official summaries, are not direct ISA press releases.
- Sources capture developments up to mid-to-late 2026; subsequent regulatory shifts in late 2026 or 2027 are not reflected.
- Policy perspectives from entities like the Competitive Enterprise Institute (CEI) reflect advocacy viewpoints regarding regulatory rollbacks.

